### 5. 付费墙：什么时候出现、出现什么

**触发时机（只有三个，全部发生在用户主动操作之后，启动时、打开 App 时、转换完成后都不弹）：**

1. 在预览页选了 **IGES** 并点“转换”。
2. 模型超过 50,000 面（减面后仍超）并点“转换”。
3. 点首页的“选择多个文件（批量）”入口（非 Pro）。

深度报告建议“转换成功之后再弹”。但 IGES 和大文件在转换**之前**就知道，转换成功后才拦就得白算一遍还要丢掉结果，体验更差。折中：用户在**预览页**已经看到自己的模型和估算时间，才碰到墙，这已经是“确认产品有用之后”。如果老板更想“先让他免费转 STEP，成功后在完成页提示‘也想要 IGES？’”，那是另一个入口（完成页的次要按钮），可以后加，本方案不做。

**行为：**

- `PaywallScreen` 保留，但结果改为下面的三种结果（`purchased` / `cancelled` / `useFree`）；购买和恢复成功后同样要经过最终权益与限制重检，不再用 bool。
- 按触发原因在顶部显示一行说明（见下表）。大文件触发时，在**可达成**的前提下增加一个免费出路按钮（契约见下）。
- 价格用 `displayPrice`。商品还没加载出来时按钮**禁用并显示“正在加载价格…”，并提供重试**；绝不显示占位或写死的价格。
- **付费墙的三种结果**（取代现在只返回 bool 的 `ensureAllowed`）：`purchased`（继续原设置，并重新检查）、`cancelled`（回到预览，什么都不改）、`useFree(ConvertSettings)`（采用改过的免费设置）。预览页拿到结果后才继续，并且**继续前对最终设置重新跑全部限制检查（`limitFor`）和内存检查（`ensureMemory`），再用这份设置构造 `ConvertRequest`**；任何一项仍命中就不放行，不能靠“已点过免费出路”绕过。
- **免费出路的规则**：
  1. 只在命中“大文件”时出现。所需比例 = 向下取整到 5 的倍数的 `floor(50000 × 100 / 面数)`；现有滑块范围 5%–95%、步长 5%，所以**面数超过 1,000,000（5% 仍超限）或所需比例低于 5% 时不显示该按钮**，不承诺做不到的事。
  2. 如果同时选了 IGES：按钮文案改为“Reduce to {percent}% and export STEP free / 减到 {percent}% 并导出 STEP（免费）”，点击把格式改成 STEP **和**比例一起写回；绝不在 IGES 下放行免费减面。想要 IGES 只能购买。
  3. 只命中 IGES（面数没超）时没有减面按钮，只有“购买”“改用 STEP（免费）”（把格式改为 STEP 并继续）、“以后再说”。
- “以后再说”只关闭付费墙，不改变用户的任何设置，也不记录“已拒绝”。
- 已购用户永远看不到付费墙。

**文案只有一套，包含批量。** 发布门槛见摘要第 3 条；组件测试断言付费墙标题、功能行、商品描述文案都含批量且与实际功能一致。

**文案（英文优先；中文并列，沿用 `app_strings.py` 机制，新键用 `pro.*`，不改设计表里的 `paywall.*`）：**

| 键 | English | 简体中文 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `pro.title` | Unlock IGES, batch and large files | 解锁 IGES、批量转换和大文件 |
| `pro.subtitle` | One-time purchase. No subscription. Your files never leave your phone. | 一次购买，不是订阅。文件全程在本机处理，不上传。 |
| `pro.feature.iges` | IGES export for SolidWorks, UG and more | 导出 IGES，可用于 SolidWorks、UG 等 |
| `pro.feature.batch` | Convert many files at once | 一次转换多个文件 |
| `pro.feature.large` | Models over {limit} faces | 超过 {limit} 个面的大模型 |
| `pro.free_note` | Free: STEP export for models up to {limit} faces. | 免费：{limit} 个面以内的模型可导出 STEP。 |
| `pro.buy` | Unlock Pro — {price} | 解锁 Pro — {price} |
| `pro.price_loading` | Loading price… | 正在加载价格… |
| `pro.price_retry` | Retry | 重试 |
| `pro.restore` | Restore Purchases | 恢复购买 |
| `pro.later` | Not now | 以后再说 |
| `pro.reason.iges` | IGES export is part of Pro. | IGES 导出属于 Pro。 |
| `pro.reason.triangles` | This model has {faces} faces. Free conversion covers up to {limit}. | 这个模型有 {faces} 个面。免费版最多转换 {limit} 个面。 |
| `pro.reason.batch` | Converting several files at once is part of Pro. | 一次转换多个文件属于 Pro。 |
| `pro.reduce` | Reduce to {percent}% and convert free | 减到 {percent}% 免费转换 |
| `pro.reduce.step` | Reduce to {percent}% and export STEP free | 减到 {percent}% 并导出 STEP（免费） |
| `pro.use_step` | Use STEP instead (free) | 改用 STEP（免费） |
| `pro.status.pro` | Pro (unlocked) | Pro（已解锁） |
| `pro.status.free` | Free | 免费版 |
| `pro.success` | Pro unlocked. Thank you! | 已解锁 Pro，感谢支持！ |
| `pro.restored` | Purchase restored | 已恢复购买 |
| `pro.nothing_to_restore` | No purchases to restore | 没有找到可恢复的购买 |
| `pro.pending` | Purchase pending approval. It will unlock automatically once approved. | 购买正在等待批准，批准后会自动解锁。 |
| `pro.unverified` | The purchase could not be verified yet. Please try again later; there is no need to pay again. | 购买暂时无法验证，请稍后重试，无需再次付款。 |
| `pro.cancelled` | Purchase cancelled | 已取消购买 |
| `pro.failed` | Purchase did not complete: {msg} | 购买未完成：{msg} |
| `pro.unavailable` | The App Store is not available right now. Conversion is not affected. | 暂时无法连接 App Store，转换功能不受影响。 |

说明：

- 中文也统一叫 **Pro**（现有中文叫“完整版”，会一并改成 Pro，和英文、商品名一致）。旧的 `purchase.*`/`paywall.*` 键里被替换的删除，Mock/非 iOS 仍用的保留，**所有键中英文都要有，沿用 `i18n_test` 的约束**（英文无中文、购买类键不得与中文相同）。
- 感叹号：沿用老板已批准的 `support.thanks` 例外；`pro.success` 也带感叹号，需要在 `core_test` 的窄豁免里再加这一个键（需老板确认，§12）。
- 设置页（iOS）新增：购买分组里显示“Pro（已解锁）/免费版”状态行，点开进入付费墙/状态；**“恢复购买”恢复回来**（上一轮因为 Pro 不卖而去掉）；打赏入口不变。
- 打赏页文案不动，但在打赏页说明里保留“不解锁任何功能”那句，和 Pro 彻底分开，付费墙里不放打赏入口。

### 6. 恢复购买
import 'dart:convert';
import 'dart:io';

import 'package:path/path.dart' as p;

import '../core/models.dart';

class HistoryEntry {
  HistoryEntry({
    required this.outputPath,
    required this.format,
    required this.bytes,
    required this.time,
    required this.sourceName,
    required this.settings,
  });

  final String outputPath;
  final ExportFormat format;
  final int bytes;
  final DateTime time;
  final String sourceName;
  final ConvertSettings settings;

  String get fileName => p.basename(outputPath);
  bool get exists => File(outputPath).existsSync();

  Map<String, Object?> toJson() => {
        'outputPath': outputPath,
        'format': format.name,
        'bytes': bytes,
        'time': time.toUtc().toIso8601String(),
        'sourceName': sourceName,
        'settings': settings.toJson(),
      };

  static HistoryEntry fromJson(Map<String, Object?> j) => HistoryEntry(
        outputPath: j['outputPath'] as String,
        format: ExportFormat.values.firstWhere((f) => f.name == j['format'], orElse: () => ExportFormat.step),
        bytes: (j['bytes'] as num).toInt(),
        time: DateTime.parse(j['time'] as String).toLocal(),
        sourceName: (j['sourceName'] as String?) ?? '',
        settings: ConvertSettings.fromJson((j['settings'] as Map).cast<String, Object?>()),
      );
}

/// History persisted as JSON next to the outputs (ui-spec §4.12), newest first, max 50.
class HistoryStore {
  HistoryStore(this.file);
  final File file;
  static const maxEntries = 50;

  List<HistoryEntry> load() {
    try {
      if (!file.existsSync()) return [];
      final list = jsonDecode(file.readAsStringSync()) as List;
      return [for (final e in list) HistoryEntry.fromJson((e as Map).cast<String, Object?>())];
    } catch (_) {
      return [];
    }
  }

  void save(List<HistoryEntry> entries) {
    file.parent.createSync(recursive: true);
    file.writeAsStringSync(jsonEncode([for (final e in entries.take(maxEntries)) e.toJson()]));
  }
}
import 'dart:convert';
import 'dart:io';

import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:shared_preferences/shared_preferences.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/app.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/core/demo_engine.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/l10n/strings.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/screens/paywall_screen.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/screens/settings_screen.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/screens/support_screen.dart';
import 'package:stl2stp_app/state/app_state.dart';

final _cjk = RegExp(r'[　-〿㐀-䶿一-鿿＀-￯]');

Map<String, String> _load(String name) =>
    (jsonDecode(File('assets/i18n/$name.json').readAsStringSync()) as Map).cast<String, String>();

void main() {
  setUpAll(() async {
    TestWidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();
    await S.preload();
  });

  group('English coverage', () {
    final en = {..._load('en'), ..._load('app_en')};
    final zh = {..._load('zh'), ..._load('app_zh')};

    test('every Chinese key has an English string, and the reverse', () {
      expect(en.keys.toSet(), zh.keys.toSet());
      for (final k in zh.keys) {
        expect(en[k]!.trim(), isNotEmpty, reason: k);
      }
    });

    test('no Chinese left in English strings (language names excepted)', () {
      // The language picker shows each language in its own name.
      const allowed = {'x.language.zh'};
      final bad = [for (final e in en.entries) if (!allowed.contains(e.key) && _cjk.hasMatch(e.value)) e.key];
      expect(bad, isEmpty);
    });

    test('purchase, restore, tip and error strings are all translated', () {
      final keys = en.keys.where((k) => RegExp(r'^(support|purchase|paywall|settings\.purchase|x\.reset_purchase)').hasMatch(k));
      expect(keys.length, greaterThan(20));
      for (final k in keys) {
        expect(_cjk.hasMatch(en[k]!), isFalse, reason: k);
        if (k != 'purchase.limit.title') expect(en[k] != zh[k], isTrue, reason: 'untranslated: $k');
      }
    });

    test('Chinese only appears in Dart code next to an isZh switch', () {
      final offenders = <String>[];
      for (final f in Directory('lib').listSync(recursive: true).whereType<File>().where((f) => f.path.endsWith('.dart'))) {
        final lines = f.readAsLinesSync();
        for (var i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {
          final l = lines[i].trim();
          if (!_cjk.hasMatch(l) || l.startsWith('//') || l.startsWith('///') || l.startsWith('*')) continue;
          if (!l.contains('isZh')) offenders.add('${f.path}:${i + 1}: $l');
        }
      }
      expect(offenders, isEmpty);
    });
  });

  group('follows the system language', () {
    Future<AppState> state(WidgetTester tester, [Map<String, Object> init = const {}]) async {
      SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues({'onboardingSeen': true, ...init});
      final p = await SharedPreferences.getInstance();
      final dir = Directory.systemTemp.createTempSync('stl2stp_i18n');
      addTearDown(() => dir.deleteSync(recursive: true));
      tester.view.physicalSize = const Size(1600, 2400);
      tester.view.devicePixelRatio = 1;
      addTearDown(tester.view.reset);
      addTearDown(tester.platformDispatcher.clearAllTestValues);
      return AppState(engine: DemoEngine(), prefs: p, outputDir: dir);
    }

    String settingsTitle(WidgetTester tester) => S.of(tester.element(find.byType(Scaffold).first)).t('settings.title');

    test('default setting is "system"', () async {
      SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues({});
      final p = await SharedPreferences.getInstance();
      final dir = Directory.systemTemp.createTempSync('stl2stp_i18n');
      addTearDown(() => dir.deleteSync(recursive: true));
      expect(AppState(engine: DemoEngine(), prefs: p, outputDir: dir).language, 'system');
    });

    for (final (tag, locales, expectZh) in [
      ('English device', [const Locale('en', 'US')], false),
      ('Chinese device', [const Locale('zh', 'CN')], true),
      ('Traditional Chinese device', [const Locale.fromSubtags(languageCode: 'zh', scriptCode: 'Hant')], true),
      ('French device falls back to English', [const Locale('fr')], false),
    ]) {
      testWidgets(tag, (tester) async {
        final st = await state(tester);
        tester.platformDispatcher.localesTestValue = locales;
        tester.platformDispatcher.localeTestValue = locales.first;
        await tester.pumpWidget(Stl2StpApp(state: st, homeOverride: const SettingsScreen()));
        await tester.pumpAndSettle();
        expect(settingsTitle(tester), expectZh ? _load('zh')['settings.title'] : _load('en')['settings.title']);
        final texts = tester.widgetList<Text>(find.byType(Text)).map((t) => t.data ?? '').toList();
        final hasCjk = texts.any((t) => t != '中文' && _cjk.hasMatch(t));
        expect(hasCjk, expectZh, reason: 'visible texts: $texts');
      });
    }

    testWidgets('an explicit choice wins over the device language', (tester) async {
      final st = await state(tester, {'language': 'zh'});
      tester.platformDispatcher.localesTestValue = [const Locale('en', 'US')];
      tester.platformDispatcher.localeTestValue = const Locale('en', 'US');
      await tester.pumpWidget(Stl2StpApp(state: st, homeOverride: const SettingsScreen()));
      await tester.pumpAndSettle();
      expect(settingsTitle(tester), _load('zh')['settings.title']);
    });

    testWidgets('English device: support, paywall and home screens have no Chinese', (tester) async {
      final st = await state(tester);
      tester.platformDispatcher.localesTestValue = [const Locale('en', 'US')];
      tester.platformDispatcher.localeTestValue = const Locale('en', 'US');
      for (final screen in [const SupportScreen(), const PaywallScreen(), null]) {
        await tester.pumpWidget(Stl2StpApp(state: st, homeOverride: screen));
        await tester.pumpAndSettle();
        final texts = tester.widgetList<Text>(find.byType(Text)).map((t) => t.data ?? '').toList();
        expect(texts.where(_cjk.hasMatch), isEmpty, reason: '${screen?.runtimeType ?? 'home'}');
      }
    });
  });
}

